<h1>metaheuristic</h1>
<p>
(algorithmic technique)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
(1) A high-level algorithmic framework or approach that can be specialized to solve <a href="optimization.html"><em>optimization problems</em></a>.  (2) A high-level strategy that guides other <a href="heuristic.html"><em>heuristics</em></a> in a search for <a href="feasiblesltn.html"><em>feasible solutions</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="optimization.html"><em>optimization problem</em></a>, <a href="simulatedAnnealing.html"><em>simulated annealing</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

